{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solateria is an action Metroidvania featuring beautiful hand-drawn art and a focus on parry-based combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small fire elemental warrior with no memories, goes on a journey to find the King\u2014the only hope to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solateria, the land of the Sun, once prospered under the Primordial Flame\u2019s blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But everything changed when the Shadow Plague\u2014the most deadly catastrophe it ever faced\u2014descended. As the land fell into ruin, even the Primordial Flame, the King of Solateria and protector of all, vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a small fire warrior with no memories of the past. The only thing you can recall is a voice urging you to find the missing King and save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful bosses with stylish parrying focused combat, and embark on an epic journey to find the King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, you will have to confront the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/e31da6352dee7c322ec5e068158616cc.poster.avif?t=1766129207\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/e31da6352dee7c322ec5e068158616cc.webm?t=1766129207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/e31da6352dee7c322ec5e068158616cc.mp4?t=1766129207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylish Parry-Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master enemy attack patterns and parry with perfect timing. Parrying enemy attacks will reduce Resistance and quickly incapacitate the enemy. Also, parrying certain attack patterns perfectly allows you to choose one of the Pyron Actions to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/8c42d527251915ed22d122abd2c8d155.poster.avif?t=1766129207\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/8c42d527251915ed22d122abd2c8d155.webm?t=1766129207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/8c42d527251915ed22d122abd2c8d155.mp4?t=1766129207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heat Core System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character is a \u201cfire elemental warrior\u201d. As such, you can unlock five levels of \u201cHeat Core\u201d, each granting useful skills. Unlock the fire warrior\u2019s powers and experience endless battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration Using Combat Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use combat skills for exploration. Reach places that seem inaccessible using various movement and combat skills! You can obtain skills such as Double Jump, Air Dash, Quick Drop, Hop-over Dash, Ash Blaster, and Ash Break while playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/e95f2e1a29fd014f2f6f002cf14c7ee4.poster.avif?t=1766129207\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/e95f2e1a29fd014f2f6f002cf14c7ee4.webm?t=1766129207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Map</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully crafted world of hand-drawn art. Use various skills to find hidden elements and create shortcuts. Maybe you\u2019ll recover your lost memories while exploring this shadowed world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/1c5e9484bb3c7e3c79e16fb2af46f807.poster.avif?t=1766129207\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/1c5e9484bb3c7e3c79e16fb2af46f807.webm?t=1766129207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/1c5e9484bb3c7e3c79e16fb2af46f807.mp4?t=1766129207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2947280?t=1766129207","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2947280?t=1766129207","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/ebe4c4dd993689eb2ef9cbb5bceacd31d12a9980/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766129207","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/ebe4c4dd993689eb2ef9cbb5bceacd31d12a9980/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766129207","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes